    "body": "The maintainer reported the same defect for the post scripts, in chat on 2026-11-17:\n\n> Same file load bug for CPS files.. the list is not populated from disk on start nor can it be refreshedd.\n\nScope added to this issue:\n- At start, the post list has one entry for each `.cps` file that is in the post folder (`assets/posts`) at that moment.\n- A refresh reads the folder again. An added file gets an entry. A removed file loses its entry and gives no error.\n- The machine list and the post list use the same scan rule. If the two lists have separate code, correct the two.\n- A post that a document names and that is not in the folder is still refused by name. This rule does not change.\n\nDone means, added: the test of this issue does the same add and remove steps for a `.cps` file in a temporary post folder.\n\nIf the two lists need changes in different crates and the work is larger than one module, the worker files a second issue for the post list and names it here.\n",
